OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAKent's role in first Ordnance
OL,4,ASurvey map marked
OL,5,
OL,6,FToday, Ordnance Survey uses aircraft,
OL,7,Fsatellites, GPS and digital
OL,8,Ftechnologies to keep Britain's maps up
OL,9,Fto date. The organisation says an area
OL,10,Fthat once took years to map can now be
OL,11,Fsurveyed in about 10 days.
